!  Award for the Promotion of Smalltalk

Starting from 2010, ESUG is giving awards to the people who promote Smalltalk. 
If you happen to know some great initiative, please contact the board mentioned it with some evidence
and the board will take some actions. 

The first two winners in 2010 where
- Laurent Laffont for his pharocasts series.
- Damien Cassou for his Squeak Dev environment.
